            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A filter assembly comprising a filter housing, a first filter, and a second filter, wherein the first filter is a pre-motor filter, and the second filter is a post-motor filter, and both the first and second filters are fixed to the filter housing and are annular about a common axis, wherein the flow direction for the first filter is opposite to the flow direction for the second filter, and the flow direction for the first filter is radially inwards towards the common axis (A), and the flow direction for the second filter is radially outwards away from the common axis.</p>
            </abstract>
